    <div class="gauge"><i style="left: {{ ((latest.inflation_score + 1) / 2 * 100) | round(1) }}%"></i></div>

    <h3>{{ t("What's voting for this regime", '哪些指标在为此周期投票') }}
      {{ help("Each chip is one indicator inside the two dials. Green chips point WITH the regime call; red chips point AGAINST it. Lots of red = shaky ground (and lower 'signal agreement').", "每个标签代表两个刻度盘中的一个指标。绿色标签与周期判断同向；红色标签与之反向。红色越多 = 根基越不稳（且'信号一致度'越低）。") }}
    </h3>
    <div>
      {% for c in components_confirming %}<span class="chip chip-pos">{{ c }}</span>{% endfor %}
      {% for c in components_contradicting %}<span class="chip chip-neg">{{ c }}</span>{% endfor %}
      {% if not components_confirming and not components_contradicting %}<span class="muted">{{ t('all quiet', '一切平静') }}</span>{% endif %}
    </div>

    <h3>{{ t('Weakest link', '最薄弱环节') }}
      {{ help("Of everything currently supporting the regime call, this indicator is closest to flipping sides — the single thing most likely to change the picture.", "在当前支撑周期判断的所有指标中，这一个最接近倒戈 — 是最有可能改变全局的单一因素。") }}
    </h3>
    <p class="muted">{{ flip_plain }}</p>

    {% if latest.preference_check %}
    <h3>{{ t('Does the market agree with the regime?', '市场是否认同此周期？') }}
      {{ help("The regime implies certain sectors should lead. This checks whether they actually ARE. Agreement strengthens the call; disagreement is an early warning — when the tape stops cooperating with the story, the story is often about to change.", "此周期暗示某些板块应当领先。这里检验它们是否真的在领先。一致会强化判断；分歧则是早期预警 — 当盘面不再配合剧情时，剧情往往即将改变。") }}
    </h3>
    <p class="muted">{{ latest.preference_check.note }}
      {% if latest.preference_check.actual_ranks %}
        <span class="l-en">({% for t, r in latest.preference_check.actual_ranks.items() %}{{ t }} is #{{ r }}{{ ", " if not loop.last }}{% endfor %} of {{ latest.sector_rs | length }})</span><span class="l-zh">（{% for t, r in latest.preference_check.actual_ranks.items() %}{{ t }} 排名第 {{ r }}{{ "，" if not loop.last }}{% endfor %}，共 {{ latest.sector_rs | length }} 个）</span>
      {% endif %}
    </p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  {# internals (risk-appetite gauges) panel retired — folded into the Market State command-center's Risk-appetite factor #}
  {# market internals — risk appetite gauges retired — folded into the Market State command-center #}

  {% endif %}{# /mode != stocks — two dials + internals #}

  {% if mode != 'macro' %}
  <!-- ===================== US EQUITY SIZE & STYLE ===================== -->
  <div class="panel span6" id="size-style">
    <h2>{{ t('US equity — size &amp; style', '美股 — 规模与风格') }}
      {{ help("Is the advance broad or narrow? Small caps (Russell 2000) and mid caps measured against the large-cap S&P 500: rising = participation broadening (risk-on); falling = a narrow, mega-cap-led tape. Growth vs value is the style rotation — growth tends to lead in disinflation and slowdowns, value in reflation. Direction over the last 20 trading days; size ratios are coloured by risk-on direction, growth/value is left neutral (no inherently good side).", "上涨是广泛还是狭窄？小盘（罗素2000）与中盘对大盘标普500衡量：上行 = 参与度扩散（风险偏好）；下行 = 狭窄、由超大盘主导的盘面。成长对价值是风格轮动 — 成长在去通胀与放缓中领先，价值在再通胀中领先。看过去20个交易日的方向；规模比率按风险偏好方向着色，成长／价值保持中性（无天然的好坏方向）。") }}
    </h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th class="l">{{ t('lens', '维度') }}</th><th>{{ t('past month', '过去一月') }}</th><th class="l">{{ t("what it's saying", '它在说什么') }}</th></tr>
      {% for r in size_style %}
      <tr>
        <td class="l">{{ r.label }} {{ help(r.tip) }}</td>
        <td class="{{ r.tone }}">{{ "%+.2f" | format(r.chg) }}%</td>
        <td class="l muted">{{ r.verdict }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    {% if breadth_div %}
    <p class="muted" style="margin:10px 2px 0; font-size:13px; line-height:1.45">
      {{ t('Small-cap participation', '小盘参与度') }}:
      <b>{{ "%.0f" | format(breadth_div.sc) }}%</b>
      {{ t('of S&P 600 small caps are above their 50-day line, vs', '的标普600小盘股高于其50日均线，对比') }}
      <b>{{ "%.0f" | format(breadth_div.lc) }}%</b>
      {{ t('for the S&P 500', '的标普500') }} — {{ breadth_div.verdict }}.
    </p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== MARKET BREADTH ===================== -->
  {% if breadth_panel %}
  <div class="panel span12" id="breadth">
    <h2>{{ t('Market breadth — how many stocks are actually participating', '市场广度 — 究竟有多少股票在参与') }}
      {{ help("Breadth across the full S&P Composite 1500 (large = S&P 500, mid = S&P 400, small = S&P 600): how many stocks are advancing, how many hold above their 50- and 200-day lines, and net new 52-week highs. A strong index riding on a shrinking number of stocks is fragile — broad participation confirms a move, thinning breadth is an early warning. The % above the 50-day line also feeds the regime model's growth axis, so this is the same breadth the model reads, just made legible.", "覆盖整个标普综合 1500（大盘 = 标普500、中盘 = 标普400、小盘 = 标普600）的广度：多少股票上涨、多少守在其 50 日与 200 日均线之上，以及净创 52 周新高。指数走强却只靠越来越少的股票支撑则脆弱 — 广泛参与确认走势，广度变薄是早期预警。高于 50 日线的占比也进入周期模型的增长轴，因此这与模型读取的是同一广度，只是更直观。") }}
    </h2>
    <p class="{{ breadth_panel.comp.tone }}" style="margin:0 2px 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5">
      {{ t('Participation looks', '参与度看起来') }} <b>{{ breadth_panel.comp.label }}</b> —
      <b>{{ "%.0f" | format(breadth_panel.comp.pa50) }}%</b> {{ t('of the 1,500 are above their 50-day line', '的 1500 只股票高于其 50 日均线') }},
      <b>{{ "%.0f" | format(breadth_panel.comp.pa200) }}%</b> {{ t('above their 200-day', '高于其 200 日均线') }};
      {{ t('net new 52-week highs', '净创 52 周新高') }} <b>{{ "%+d" | format(breadth_panel.comp.net_nh) }}</b>.
      <span class="muted">{{ breadth_panel.comp.verdict }}.</span>
    </p>
    <table>
      <tr>
        <th class="l">{{ t('size tier', '规模层级') }}</th>
        <th class="l" style="min-width:170px">{{ t('advancing vs declining', '上涨对下跌') }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('&gt; 50-day', '&gt; 50 日') }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('&gt; 200-day', '&gt; 200 日') }}</th>
        <th>{{ t('net new highs', '净新高') }}
          {{ help("52-week highs minus 52-week lows today. Positive = expansion (healthy); negative = more stocks making new lows than highs (deteriorating).", "今日创 52 周新高减去创 52 周新低的数量。正 = 扩张（健康）；负 = 创新低的股票多于创新高（恶化）。") }}
        </th>
      </tr>
      {% for tier in breadth_panel.tiers %}
      <tr>
        <td class="l"><b>{{ tier.label }}</b> <span class="muted">{{ tier.univ }}</span></td>
        <td class="l">
          <span class="pos">{{ tier.adv }}</span> <span class="muted">/</span> <span class="neg">{{ tier.dec }}</span>
          {% if tier.adv_pct is not none %}<span class="bbar" title="{{ '%.0f' | format(tier.adv_pct) }}% advancing"><i style="width:{{ tier.adv_pct | round(0) }}%; background:var(--up)"></i><i style="width:{{ (100 - tier.adv_pct) | round(0) }}%; background:var(--down)"></i></span>{% endif %}
        </td>
        <td class="{{ 'pos' if tier.pa50 >= 50 else 'neg' }}">{{ "%.0f" | format(tier.pa50) }}%</td>
        <td class="{{ 'pos' if (tier.pa200 or 0) >= 50 else 'neg' }}">{% if tier.pa200 is not none %}{{ "%.0f" | format(tier.pa200) }}%{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
        <td class="{{ 'pos' if tier.net_nh >= 0 else 'neg' }}">{{ "%+d" | format(tier.net_nh) }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    <p class="muted" style="margin:8px 2px 0; font-size:11px">{{ t('As of', '截至') }} {{ breadth_panel.asof }} · {{ t('daily breadth across S&P 1500 constituents', '覆盖标普 1500 成分股的每日广度') }}</p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <!-- ===================== ADVANCED BREADTH TRACKER ===================== -->
  {% if adv_breadth %}
  {% set tc = {'pos':'var(--up)','neg':'var(--down)','muted':'var(--link)'} %}
  <div class="panel span12" id="advanced-breadth">
    <h2>{{ t('Advanced breadth — the market internals under the tape', '高级广度 — 盘面之下的市场内部结构') }}
      {{ help("The classic 'market internals' a desk watches beyond today's %-above-MA snapshot: the McClellan Oscillator & Summation Index (breadth momentum), the Zweig Breadth Thrust gauge, the High-Low Index, whether the advance/decline line confirms price, and where participation sits in its own multi-decade history. Computed on the DEEP S&P 500 breadth series (1962-). These are SECOND-DERIVATIVE reads of the same breadth — they describe the QUALITY of the move (broad vs narrow, accelerating vs rolling over). Display-only: breadth internals are a function of price, so they're coincident with it by construction — this explains the tape, it does not forecast it. Survivorship caveat: the deep series is rebuilt from today's members, so the percentile context is taken over the mature-universe window only.", "盘面之下、超越「高于均线占比」快照的经典「市场内部结构」：麦克莱伦振荡指标与累积指标（广度动量）、兹威格广度脉冲、新高—新低指数、腾落线是否确认价格，以及当前参与度在其数十年历史中的分位。基于标普500深度广度序列（1962年起）计算。这些是同一广度的二阶读数 — 描述走势的「质量」（广泛或狭窄、加速或回落）。仅作展示：内部结构是价格的函数、与价格同步，用于解释盘面而非预测。幸存者偏差提示：深度序列以当前成分股重建，故分位背景仅取成熟样本区间。") }}
    </h2>
    <details class="jarg" style="margin-top:0">
    <summary>{{ t('Show market internals — McClellan, breadth thrust, highs/lows, divergence','展开市场内部 — 麦克莱伦、广度推力、新高新低、背离') }}</summary>
    <p class="{{ adv_breadth.headline.tone }}" style="margin:10px 2px 14px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5">
    <details class="jarg"><summary>{{ t('Show market internals — McClellan, breadth thrust, highs/lows, divergence','展开市场内部 — 麦克莱伦、广度推力、新高新低、背离') }}</summary>
    <p class="{{ adv_breadth.headline.tone }}" style="margin:0 2px 14px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5">
      {{ t('The internals read', '内部结构读数为') }} <b>{{ adv_breadth.headline.label }}</b> —
      <span class="muted">{{ adv_breadth.headline.verdict }}.</span>
    </p>

    <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(248px,1fr)); gap:12px">

      <!-- McClellan -->
      {% if adv_breadth.mcc %}
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; padding:12px 13px; background:var(--panel2)">
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.02em">{{ t('McClellan Oscillator', '麦克莱伦振荡指标') }}
          {{ help("Ratio-adjusted McClellan Oscillator: the 19-day minus 39-day EMA of net advances (normalised so a changing universe size doesn't distort it). Above zero & rising = breadth momentum building; below zero & falling = internals rolling over. The Summation Index is its running total — its slope and sign carry the meaning, not the absolute (cumulative) level.", "比率调整后的麦克莱伦振荡指标：净上涨家数的19日与39日指数均线之差（已归一化，避免样本规模变化造成失真）。高于零且上行 = 广度动量在累积；低于零且下行 = 内部结构在回落。累积指标是其累计和 — 关键在斜率与正负号，而非绝对（累计）水平。") }}</div>
        <div style="display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:8px; margin:4px 0 2px">
          <b class="{{ adv_breadth.mcc.tone }}" style="font-size:22px">{{ adv_breadth.mcc.osc }}</b>
          <span class="pill {{ adv_breadth.mcc.tone }}" style="background:var(--panel)">{{ adv_breadth.mcc.band }}</span>
        </div>
        {{ adv_breadth.mcc.svg }}
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px; margin-top:3px">{{ t('Summation Index', '累积指标') }}
          <b class="{{ 'pos' if adv_breadth.mcc.summ_rising else 'neg' }}">{{ t('rising', '上行') if adv_breadth.mcc.summ_rising else t('falling', '下行') }}</b>
          <span class="muted">(20d {{ adv_breadth.mcc.summ_chg20 }})</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <!-- Breadth Thrust -->
      {% if adv_breadth.thrust %}
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; padding:12px 13px; background:var(--panel2)">
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.02em">{{ t('Breadth Thrust (Zweig)', '广度脉冲（兹威格）') }}
          {{ help("The 10-day EMA of the advancers' share, advances / (advances + declines). Zweig's classic launch signal fires when it surges from below 0.40 (washed out) through 0.615 (thrust) inside 10 days — a rare, powerful 'everything's going up at once' kick-off. HONESTY: on our survivorship-biased S&P-500 proxy the strict crossing fires far more often than the canonical ~once-a-decade NYSE signal (rebuilt-from-survivors rebounds look broader than they were live), so read this as a momentum gauge, not the rare historic trigger.", "上涨家数占比（上涨 /(上涨+下跌)）的10日指数均线。兹威格的经典启动信号：在10日内自0.40以下（超卖）急升突破0.615（脉冲）时触发 —— 罕见而强劲的「同涨」启动。诚实说明：在带有幸存者偏差的标普500代理上，严格的穿越远比经典的纽交所「十年一遇」信号更频繁（以幸存者重建的反弹看起来比当时更广），故此处作为动量计读取，而非罕见的历史触发。") }}</div>
        <div style="display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:8px; margin:4px 0 2px">
          <b class="{{ adv_breadth.thrust.tone }}" style="font-size:22px">{{ adv_breadth.thrust.value }}</b>
          <span class="pill {{ adv_breadth.thrust.tone }}" style="background:var(--panel)">{{ adv_breadth.thrust.zone }}</span>
        </div>
        <span style="position:relative; display:block; height:10px; background:var(--panel); border-radius:5px; margin:10px 0 6px" title="0.40 washed → 0.615 thrust">
          <i style="position:absolute; left:{{ adv_breadth.thrust.washed_pos }}%; top:-3px; width:2px; height:16px; background:var(--muted); opacity:.7"></i>
          <i style="position:absolute; left:{{ adv_breadth.thrust.thrust_pos }}%; top:-3px; width:2px; height:16px; background:var(--up)"></i>
          <i style="position:absolute; left:calc({{ adv_breadth.thrust.pos }}% - 5px); top:0; width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%; background:{{ tc[adv_breadth.thrust.tone] }}; box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--panel2)"></i>
        </span>
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px; margin-top:3px">
          {% if adv_breadth.thrust.recent %}<b class="pos">{{ t('strict thrust fired in the last month', '近一月内触发严格脉冲') }}</b>{% else %}{{ t('last strict thrust', '上次严格脉冲') }} <b>{{ adv_breadth.thrust.last or '—' }}</b>{% endif %}
          <span class="muted">· {{ adv_breadth.thrust.hist_count }} {{ t('since 2005', '次（2005年以来）') }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <!-- High-Low Index -->
      {% if adv_breadth.hl %}
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; padding:12px 13px; background:var(--panel2)">
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.02em">{{ t('High-Low Index', '新高—新低指数') }}
          {{ help("The 10-day average of the record-high percent: 52-week new highs as a share of (new highs + new lows). Above 50 = new highs are outpacing new lows (an expanding, healthy new-high ledger); below 50 = the new-low side is winning (deterioration). Today's raw net new highs (highs minus lows) and their 10-day average are shown below.", "记录新高占比的10日均值：52周新高占（新高+新低）的比例。高于50 = 新高多于新低（新高账本在扩张、健康）；低于50 = 新低占上风（恶化）。下方显示今日净新高（新高减新低）及其10日均值。") }}</div>
        <div style="display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:8px; margin:4px 0 2px">
          <b class="{{ adv_breadth.hl.tone }}" style="font-size:22px">{{ adv_breadth.hl.hli }}</b>
          <span class="pill {{ adv_breadth.hl.tone }}" style="background:var(--panel)">{{ adv_breadth.hl.band }}</span>
        </div>
        {{ adv_breadth.hl.svg }}
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px; margin-top:3px">{{ t('net new highs', '净新高') }}
          <b class="{{ 'pos' if adv_breadth.hl.net_nh[0] != '-' else 'neg' }}">{{ adv_breadth.hl.net_nh }}</b>
          {{ t('today', '今日') }} · <b>{{ adv_breadth.hl.net_nh_10 }}</b> {{ t('avg 10d', '10日均') }}
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <!-- A/D vs price divergence -->
      {% if adv_breadth.div %}
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; padding:12px 13px; background:var(--panel2)">
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.02em">{{ t('A/D line vs price', '腾落线对价格') }}
          {{ help("Does the cumulative advance/decline line confirm the index's recent extremes? If price prints a fresh 3-month high the A/D line will NOT confirm, the advance is narrowing underneath (bearish divergence); a fresh price low the A/D line refuses to confirm is a bullish divergence. Otherwise the internals are confirming the move, or nothing is at an extreme (in range). The sparkline traces the A/D line; the correlation is price-vs-A/D over the last 60 sessions.", "累积腾落线是否确认指数近期的极值？若价格创3个月新高而腾落线未确认，则上涨在底层收窄（看跌背离）；若价格创新低而腾落线拒绝确认，则为看涨背离。否则即为内部结构确认走势，或均未触及极值（区间内）。曲线描绘腾落线；相关系数为近60个交易日价格与腾落线的相关性。") }}</div>
        <div style="display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:8px; margin:4px 0 2px; min-height:30px">
          <b class="{{ adv_breadth.div.tone }}" style="font-size:16px">{{ adv_breadth.div.label }}</b>
        </div>
        {{ adv_breadth.div.svg }}
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px; margin-top:3px">{{ adv_breadth.div.verdict }}.
          {% if adv_breadth.div.corr is not none %}<span class="muted">({{ adv_breadth.div.window }}d corr {{ adv_breadth.div.corr }})</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <!-- Participation in historical context -->
      {% if adv_breadth.par %}
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; padding:12px 13px; background:var(--panel2)">
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.02em">{{ t('Participation in context', '参与度的历史背景') }}
          {{ help("Today's % of S&P 500 stocks above their 50-day line, set against its own deep history: the percentile tells you where this reading ranks vs every day since the universe matured, and the 20-day change is the momentum of participation (is it broadening or thinning?). The advance/decline line direction over 20 days rounds it out.", "今日标普500中高于50日均线的股票占比，对照其自身的深度历史：分位数显示该读数相对样本成熟以来每一天的排名，20日变化为参与度的动量（在扩散还是变薄？）。再辅以腾落线20日方向。") }}</div>
        <div style="display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:8px; margin:4px 0 2px">
          <b class="{{ adv_breadth.par.tone }}" style="font-size:22px">{{ adv_breadth.par.pa50 }}%</b>
          {% if adv_breadth.par.pctile is not none %}<span class="pill" style="background:var(--panel)">{{ adv_breadth.par.pctile }}{{ t('th pct', '分位') }} · {{ t('since', '自') }} {{ adv_breadth.par.hist_from }}</span>{% endif %}
        </div>
        {{ adv_breadth.par.svg }}
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px; margin-top:3px">
          {% if adv_breadth.par.pa200 %}&gt;200d <b>{{ adv_breadth.par.pa200 }}%</b> · {% endif %}{{ t('20d', '20日') }} <b class="{{ adv_breadth.par.chg_tone }}">{{ adv_breadth.par.chg20 }}</b>
          {% if adv_breadth.par.ad_dir %} · {{ t('A/D', '腾落') }} <b class="{{ 'pos' if adv_breadth.par.ad_dir == 'up' else 'neg' }}">{{ t('up', '上行') if adv_breadth.par.ad_dir == 'up' else t('down', '下行') }}</b>{% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <!-- Cross-tier participation gap -->
      {% if adv_breadth.gap %}
      <div style="border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; padding:12px 13px; background:var(--panel2)">
        <div class="muted" style="font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.02em">{{ t('Large / mid / small gap', '大／中／小盘差') }}
          {{ help("The % > 50-day line for each S&P size tier (500 / 400 / 600), and the small-minus-large gap. Small caps participating MORE than large = a healthy, broad-based tape; small lagging = a narrow, mega-cap-led advance that's more fragile.", "标普各规模层级（500／400／600）高于50日均线的占比，以及「小盘减大盘」之差。小盘参与度高于大盘 = 健康、广泛的盘面；小盘落后 = 狭窄、由超大盘主导、更脆弱的上涨。") }}</div>
